<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Sheppard Lawn Care | Lawn Mowing in [Your Town]</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reliable, friendly lawn care in [Your Town]. Mowing, edging, and cleanup.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@600;800&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

  <header class="site-header">
    <a href="#top" class="brand">Sheppard Lawn Care</a>
    <button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false">Menu</button>
    <nav class="nav" id="nav">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Get a quote</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="top">

    <!-- HERO: the striped background looks like a freshly mowed lawn -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <h1>Clean lines. Fair prices. Your neighbor next door.</h1>
        <p>Sheppard Lawn Care keeps yards in [Your Town] looking sharp, with mowing you can count on every two weeks.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn">Get a free quote</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="services" class="section">
      <h2>What I do</h2>
      <ul class="services">
        <li>
          <h3>Mowing</h3>
          <p>Weekly or every other week, cut at the height your grass likes best.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Edging and trimming</h3>
          <p>Crisp edges along sidewalks, driveways, and flower beds.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Cleanup</h3>
          <p>Clippings blown off the driveway and walkways before I leave.</p>
        </li>
        <!-- Add more services by copying a <li> block -->
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="section section-alt">
      <div class="about">
        <h2>Local and reliable</h2>
        <p>Hi, I'm [Your First Name] Sheppard. I started Sheppard Lawn Care to keep [Your Town] yards looking great. I show up on schedule, do the job right, and treat every lawn like it's my own.</p>
        <p><strong>Service area:</strong> [Your Town] and nearby areas.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="reviews" class="section">
      <h2>What customers say</h2>
      <div class="reviews">
        <blockquote>
          <p>"Add a short review from your first customer here."</p>
          <cite>[Customer name or initials]</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote>
          <p>"Add a short review from your second customer here."</p>
          <cite>[Customer name or initials]</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="section section-alt">
      <div class="contact">
        <h2>Ask for a free quote</h2>
        <p>Tell me about your yard and I'll get back to you soon. You can also call or text <a href="tel:+10000000000">(000) 000-0000</a>.</p>
        <form id="quote-form" novalidate>
          <label>Name
            <input type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name">
          </label>
          <label>Address or street
            <input type="text" name="address" required autocomplete="street-address">
          </label>
          <label>Anything I should know?
            <textarea name="message" rows="4"></textarea>
          </label>
          <button type="submit" class="btn">Send request</button>
          <p class="form-note" id="form-note" role="status"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> Sheppard Lawn Care. [Your Town]</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
